---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/Page.astro";
---
<style>
	p {
		width: 700px;
	}

</style>
<PageLayout>
	<div class="centered">
		<h1>About Us</h1>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p><u>We are the Sacramento chapter of Food Not Bombs, a global mutual aid movement and tradition.</u> As our name implies, we believe that food, among other necessities, IS a human right. 
				 We also believe that the fruits of our labor and the land should go directly into our own communities, NOT towards war, hate, and greedy profiteers.</p>
		</div>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p>We believe all people are equal and that no one should be left thirsty, starving, cold, or without medical help when we have far more than enough resources to take care of everyone in need.</p>
		</div>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p>We are all in this together, and the world only gets better when we help each other however we can, from a place of genuine compassion and love for our friends and neighbors.</p>
		</div>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p>Through our collective action, we wish to help create a better world for all.</p>
		</div>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p class="centered"><a href="faqs">Click here for our FAQs!</a></p>
		</div>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p class="centered"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DTbFgcPkpn-/?img_index=1">Click here to read our full Statement of Values</a></p>
		</div>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
